        "created_at": "2017-08-05T14:32:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got more people who like this game. Played it twice withanother new group and they loved it. One of them even sat and started to read all the rules and the cards. Just sharing thier praise.<br>\nThunder speaker running around with it’s militia murdering the invaders. Always wanted to gather troop to be on the offense.<br>\nOr lighting bird making everything quick actions. Speeds the game and changes strategy.<br>\nExcelent theming.</p>",
